1
00:00:09,034 --> 00:00:11,354
[This program is suitable for viewers aged 13 and up.]

2
00:00:11,354 --> 00:00:14,228
[May contain images, sounds,
and content that require viewer discretion.]

3
00:00:14,228 --> 00:00:15,678
[This program presents personal beliefs only.]

4
00:00:15,678 --> 00:00:17,358
[There is no intention to guide or persuade.
Viewer discretion is advised.]

5
00:00:17,358 --> 00:00:18,638
[Personal details and stories
presented in this program]

6
00:00:18,638 --> 00:00:20,317
[are shared with participants' voluntary consent.]

7
00:00:20,883 --> 00:00:22,600
(For three weeks)

8
00:00:22,600 --> 00:00:25,062
(in a bid to prove to the world)

9
00:00:25,062 --> 00:00:27,880
(that the unseen truly exists.)

10
00:00:32,640 --> 00:00:36,360
(Today, twenty-four of Asia's top masters)

11
00:00:36,360 --> 00:00:39,202
(are entering an arena,)

12
00:00:39,202 --> 00:00:44,120
(crossing the line between the human and spirit worlds)

13
00:00:46,160 --> 00:00:48,200
(through the art of divination)

14
00:00:48,200 --> 00:00:50,560
(and supernatural power)

15
00:00:50,560 --> 00:00:53,360
(to become one of six masters)

16
00:00:53,360 --> 00:00:56,697
(who will claim the Seer's Throne.)

17
00:01:12,258 --> 00:01:13,220
Hello, everyone.

18
00:01:13,220 --> 00:01:15,411
Welcome to

19
00:01:15,411 --> 00:01:18,542
[Push Puttichai Kasetsin]
the premier Asian arena of divination,

20
00:01:18,542 --> 00:01:21,321
UNSEEN: Battle for the Seer's Throne!

21
00:01:23,053 --> 00:01:28,560
We have twenty-four masters advancing to this round.

22
00:01:28,560 --> 00:01:30,600
Let's see who they are.

23
00:01:32,496 --> 00:01:39,533
[Advanced Masters]

24
00:01:39,533 --> 00:01:40,562
Because in this round,

25
00:01:40,562 --> 00:01:45,158
we'll select the six masters
who deliver the best results.

26
00:01:45,158 --> 00:01:48,258
Those six will become the Top Six

27
00:01:48,258 --> 00:01:49,202
and take their seats

28
00:01:49,202 --> 00:01:51,162
on the Seer's Throne,

29
00:01:51,162 --> 00:01:52,642
right here on my left.

30
00:01:53,420 --> 00:01:56,802
Of course, those who make the Top Six

31
00:01:56,802 --> 00:01:59,928
and claim the Seer's Throne

32
00:01:59,928 --> 00:02:03,442
will earn special privileges in the next round.

33
00:02:04,745 --> 00:02:07,812
So I'm telling you all right now.

34
00:02:07,812 --> 00:02:09,190
No allies,

35
00:02:09,190 --> 00:02:10,562
no friends.

36
00:02:11,057 --> 00:02:12,191
I think

37
00:02:12,717 --> 00:02:15,870
[Kan - Card Divination/Thai Astrology]
I belong up there.

38
00:02:15,870 --> 00:02:17,794
[Namo - Feng Shui]
For a second, I wondered if it'd be me, too.

39
00:02:18,036 --> 00:02:19,713
This round,

40
00:02:19,713 --> 00:02:22,473
you won't just stay in the studio.

41
00:02:22,473 --> 00:02:25,673
You're heading out to real locations.

42
00:02:25,673 --> 00:02:29,044
Today, I will divide you all into three groups.

43
00:02:29,044 --> 00:02:32,742
Eight per group, traveling to three locations.

44
00:02:34,993 --> 00:02:37,102
Three places

45
00:02:37,102 --> 00:02:41,356
tied to life-changing events.

46
00:02:41,356 --> 00:02:42,673
Everything you see,

47
00:02:43,109 --> 00:02:45,064
every answer you give,

48
00:02:45,064 --> 00:02:46,673
and every judgment

49
00:02:46,673 --> 00:02:50,333
will be your work and yours alone.

50
00:02:50,553 --> 00:02:51,993
At the end of this round,

51
00:02:51,993 --> 00:02:54,913
only sixteen masters

52
00:02:54,913 --> 00:02:57,193
will advance to the next round.

53
00:02:57,193 --> 00:03:01,233
And eight masters will be eliminated

54
00:03:01,233 --> 00:03:02,673
and sent home.

55
00:03:04,665 --> 00:03:06,764
Here are the three groups I've arranged today.

56
00:03:06,764 --> 00:03:07,484
Boy,

57
00:03:07,484 --> 00:03:11,306
Yiam, Ha Byung-yeol, Hwang Hye-mi, Boom,

58
00:03:11,564 --> 00:03:13,755
Dear, Beam, Piipiim.

59
00:03:20,675 --> 00:03:23,635
[Pathum Thani]
How was it being on-site in Pathum Thani?

60
00:03:25,155 --> 00:03:28,035
Driving past, you'd never know a house was in there.

61
00:03:28,434 --> 00:03:30,303
You can feel

62
00:03:31,183 --> 00:03:33,681
something gloomy and suffocating.

63
00:03:35,509 --> 00:03:38,394
[Ploenta Daengserikul, Pathum Thani Homeowner]
This house feels strange.

64
00:03:38,891 --> 00:03:40,527
People keep dying here,

65
00:03:40,847 --> 00:03:42,193
five so far.

66
00:03:42,193 --> 00:03:44,170
[Five deaths in this house]
Nothing ever goes right for long.

67
00:03:44,245 --> 00:03:46,757
[Living here brings endless trouble]
Just when things look up, something goes wrong.

68
00:03:46,917 --> 00:03:49,327
[Family members died unnaturally]
Whenever I save a little money, it's gone.

69
00:03:51,487 --> 00:03:53,980
Is there something good or bad here?

70
00:03:53,980 --> 00:03:56,660
Is there something bad in this house?

71
00:03:56,660 --> 00:03:58,263
I want you to look into that.

72
00:04:03,051 --> 00:04:07,894
This is where all the masters
will carry out their mission.

73
00:04:07,894 --> 00:04:10,618
It's a real, lived-in home.

74
00:04:10,778 --> 00:04:12,974
You're not just here to make predictions,

75
00:04:12,974 --> 00:04:15,734
but to help uncover the problems inside,

76
00:04:15,734 --> 00:04:18,270
and what's happening in this house.

77
00:04:22,174 --> 00:04:24,971
[Piipiim - Runes/Tarot cards]
I'm suffocated. My heart's pounding.

78
00:04:25,294 --> 00:04:28,094
[Ha Byung-yeol - Saju]
There's so much energy here. I feel terrible.

79
00:04:28,814 --> 00:04:31,374
Yin is the power of darkness.

80
00:04:31,654 --> 00:04:33,174
The energy here is intense.

81
00:04:33,174 --> 00:04:34,094
[Boy - Thai Astrology/Tarot Cards/Oracle Cards]
I've got chills.

82
00:04:34,294 --> 00:04:36,183
[Beam - Maa Kaali Oracle Cards]
It feels like rain's coming.

83
00:04:38,614 --> 00:04:39,494
The wind's strong.

84
00:04:39,894 --> 00:04:42,134
Instead of all the trees swaying,

85
00:04:42,134 --> 00:04:44,054
only that one tall tree

86
00:04:44,734 --> 00:04:45,774
is thrashing wildly.

87
00:04:47,494 --> 00:04:48,494
Man, chills.

88
00:04:49,454 --> 00:04:50,734
Aoy.

89
00:04:50,734 --> 00:04:52,854
Let us film this show, sweetheart.

90
00:04:52,854 --> 00:04:56,694
Let it go smoothly. No rain, no storms, please.

91
00:04:56,694 --> 00:04:58,797
If it doesn't rain, I'll offer you a chicken

92
00:04:58,797 --> 00:04:59,854
and

93
00:04:59,854 --> 00:05:00,774
a big bottle of Pepsi.

94
00:05:00,774 --> 00:05:01,894
If it rains, you get nothing.

95
00:05:06,414 --> 00:05:08,448
I first asked what we'd encounter on this shoot.

96
00:05:08,448 --> 00:05:09,688
I only knew it was on a real location,

97
00:05:09,688 --> 00:05:11,270
so I drew the cards to find out.

98
00:05:13,397 --> 00:05:15,545
[Boom - Tarot Cards]
And the cards revealed

99
00:05:15,545 --> 00:05:19,814
we'd go to an old place by the water.

100
00:05:20,023 --> 00:05:21,574
I asked the cards what we'd find.

101
00:05:21,574 --> 00:05:22,485
The cards show

102
00:05:22,485 --> 00:05:25,167
a female homeowner came up.

103
00:05:25,974 --> 00:05:28,715
Standing beside me is Ms. Ploenta,

104
00:05:28,715 --> 00:05:30,174
the owner of this place.

105
00:05:30,625 --> 00:05:31,894
[Ms. Ploen, Pathum Thani Homeowner]

106
00:05:31,894 --> 00:05:33,134
Everything you see

107
00:05:33,134 --> 00:05:36,856
and every answer must be presented to the two of us.

108
00:05:40,478 --> 00:05:41,917
I pick up things fast,

109
00:05:42,758 --> 00:05:44,558
so I have to write fast.

110
00:05:44,558 --> 00:05:47,581
All I have is a pen and paper.

111
00:06:02,558 --> 00:06:06,241
I sense both a man and a woman alternating,

112
00:06:06,327 --> 00:06:08,785
watching from this window.

113
00:06:11,008 --> 00:06:12,739
From what I see, I feel like

114
00:06:12,739 --> 00:06:15,614
sorrow, grief, and disappointment.

115
00:06:19,056 --> 00:06:20,278
Guardian spirits,

116
00:06:21,150 --> 00:06:23,587
please open the way and tell me.

117
00:06:24,478 --> 00:06:26,291
I sense

118
00:06:30,238 --> 00:06:32,118
there's a child among the deceased,

119
00:06:33,758 --> 00:06:34,884
inside the house.

120
00:06:36,263 --> 00:06:38,078
Recently moved?

121
00:06:38,828 --> 00:06:39,958
Seven or eight years.

122
00:06:40,527 --> 00:06:41,339
And the house...

123
00:06:42,598 --> 00:06:46,358
This house was probably moved.
This is probably the second time.

124
00:06:46,358 --> 00:06:49,678
"Recently moved" probably means
around five to seven years ago.

125
00:06:50,558 --> 00:06:51,358
Is that true?

126
00:06:51,428 --> 00:06:51,995
Spot on.

127
00:06:51,995 --> 00:06:52,935
Oh, my!

128
00:06:54,378 --> 00:06:57,358
[Old house]

129
00:06:57,358 --> 00:06:58,398
Dear.

130
00:06:58,398 --> 00:06:59,241
Yes.

131
00:06:59,241 --> 00:07:00,641
The homeowner said "spot on."

132
00:07:10,232 --> 00:07:11,164
Deaths.

133
00:07:16,018 --> 00:07:17,853
Three to five?

134
00:07:19,862 --> 00:07:21,540
Ancestors?

135
00:07:23,794 --> 00:07:25,874
Hanging... I'll note that down.

136
00:07:25,874 --> 00:07:26,949
It just flashed in.

137
00:07:43,181 --> 00:07:45,644
If I'm standing here

138
00:07:45,644 --> 00:07:49,233
and this place wants me to uncover and fix it...

139
00:07:49,233 --> 00:07:51,490
Dear is testing something.

140
00:07:51,490 --> 00:07:54,577
She suspects someone died by hanging.

141
00:07:55,594 --> 00:07:58,661
Please send a strong gust of wind,

142
00:07:58,661 --> 00:08:00,658
since humans can only feel the wind.

143
00:08:09,344 --> 00:08:11,384
I really feel like

144
00:08:11,384 --> 00:08:13,144
the most powerful ones here

145
00:08:13,144 --> 00:08:14,544
are Dear

146
00:08:15,864 --> 00:08:17,889
and Hye-mi, the Korean spirit medium.

147
00:08:19,160 --> 00:08:22,464
They both can communicate with these things.

148
00:08:22,464 --> 00:08:24,344
Because they

149
00:08:24,344 --> 00:08:27,264
already sense something in this house.

150
00:08:30,591 --> 00:08:33,132
I sense some kind of energy.

151
00:08:33,831 --> 00:08:34,911
Ah, there's quite a lot.

152
00:08:35,911 --> 00:08:37,631
Oh, so that's how they lived.

153
00:08:37,631 --> 00:08:39,271
Something keeps pulling at me.

154
00:08:42,431 --> 00:08:43,542
Oh, here.

155
00:08:47,471 --> 00:08:48,271
This place.

156
00:08:49,391 --> 00:08:53,535
I feel a very strong spirit energy over there.

157
00:08:53,751 --> 00:08:55,431
Why? Why did you die?

158
00:08:57,911 --> 00:08:58,943
Couldn't bear it anymore?

159
00:09:00,831 --> 00:09:02,431
You just wanted to rest?

160
00:09:10,151 --> 00:09:11,031
It's a man.

161
00:09:13,991 --> 00:09:14,871
So that's how it is.

162
00:09:15,231 --> 00:09:16,111
Water.

163
00:09:21,031 --> 00:09:22,199
He's gone.

164
00:09:22,455 --> 00:09:23,231
Oh, my!

165
00:09:23,671 --> 00:09:24,197
Goosebumps.

166
00:09:24,518 --> 00:09:28,632
Uncle Monk Kob died right next door
by the drainage pipe.

167
00:09:28,836 --> 00:09:31,240
This one is my husband's older brother.

168
00:09:34,111 --> 00:09:36,334
You could call him a spirit drifting in the water.

169
00:09:36,334 --> 00:09:38,593
A male spirit.

170
00:09:38,647 --> 00:09:39,503
[Chanting incantation]

171
00:09:40,271 --> 00:09:41,071
Who are you?

172
00:09:41,631 --> 00:09:43,766
That man keeps following me.

173
00:09:44,791 --> 00:09:47,191
I feel an unusually huge, intense energy.

174
00:09:47,191 --> 00:09:50,431
Something definitely happened here.

175
00:09:50,431 --> 00:09:52,295
Did someone drown here?

176
00:09:53,994 --> 00:09:55,511
I'll have to check.

177
00:10:05,301 --> 00:10:07,671
In moments like this, the dying often feel

178
00:10:08,123 --> 00:10:10,303
such injustice! It's not fair! It's so bitter!

179
00:10:10,731 --> 00:10:12,231
They really didn't want to die.

180
00:10:13,573 --> 00:10:15,412
There's so much pain here.

181
00:10:15,711 --> 00:10:17,911
And so much suffering.

182
00:10:17,951 --> 00:10:19,431
I've had that kind of feelings many times.

183
00:10:27,151 --> 00:10:30,031
He says they've been together a very long time.

184
00:10:44,191 --> 00:10:46,591
It's like someone is trembling in fear.

185
00:10:48,511 --> 00:10:51,225
My throat feels dry, hoarse, and it keeps hurting.

186
00:10:59,071 --> 00:11:00,192
Darn it.

187
00:11:03,463 --> 00:11:06,431
This was written before going in.

188
00:11:09,271 --> 00:11:11,071
This one was before going in, right?

189
00:11:11,361 --> 00:11:14,831
Father and Grandfather hung themselves.
I'll keep that as an option.

190
00:11:25,094 --> 00:11:27,431
My throat feels awful.

191
00:11:27,911 --> 00:11:30,231
It's a distorted kind of death,

192
00:11:30,431 --> 00:11:32,871
all like taking their own lives.

193
00:11:33,071 --> 00:11:36,669
His throat must have hurt so much.

194
00:11:37,551 --> 00:11:42,471
The pain that spirit suffered

195
00:11:42,590 --> 00:11:43,831
and that when they were alive

196
00:11:43,831 --> 00:11:45,871
can be channeled through a spirit medium

197
00:11:45,871 --> 00:11:47,351
so we can feel it.

198
00:11:47,351 --> 00:11:48,351
Hanging,

199
00:11:48,351 --> 00:11:49,116
one hundred percent.

200
00:11:49,116 --> 00:11:50,199
I'm sensing a lot of energy

201
00:11:50,199 --> 00:11:52,071
from spirits who died by suicide.

202
00:11:52,071 --> 00:11:54,303
There must be a reason my throat hurts this much.

203
00:11:54,303 --> 00:11:55,400
It feels like my throat was pierced or punctured.

204
00:11:57,394 --> 00:11:58,634
A young man killed himself.

205
00:11:58,701 --> 00:12:00,123
He died by hanging.

206
00:12:00,123 --> 00:12:02,074
He keeps trying to reach me.

207
00:12:04,434 --> 00:12:05,994
No, no, you can't do that.

208
00:12:06,994 --> 00:12:07,794
So accurate.

209
00:12:08,834 --> 00:12:10,514
He's around the same age as her son.

210
00:12:10,514 --> 00:12:13,760
[The deceased who took his own life]
The one who keeps following her.

211
00:12:14,034 --> 00:12:16,474
And he keeps following me,

212
00:12:16,806 --> 00:12:17,789
wanting to tell me something.

213
00:12:19,834 --> 00:12:21,070
Stay away!

214
00:12:21,354 --> 00:12:23,474
Ugh, my head's splitting.

215
00:12:23,554 --> 00:12:25,357
Why do you keep trying to enter my body?

216
00:12:25,357 --> 00:12:26,314
No.

217
00:12:29,431 --> 00:12:31,794
If that's true, please let the wind stop.

218
00:12:33,954 --> 00:12:35,074
Let everything stop.

219
00:12:40,394 --> 00:12:41,686
Thank you.

220
00:12:43,030 --> 00:12:45,653
(It's time to answer the questions.)

221
00:12:49,795 --> 00:12:50,943
Hello.

222
00:12:51,488 --> 00:12:52,289
Ready?

223
00:12:54,245 --> 00:12:55,122
Just a second.

224
00:12:58,715 --> 00:12:59,813
Calm down, ma'am.

225
00:12:59,813 --> 00:13:00,675
Calm down.

226
00:13:00,915 --> 00:13:01,556
Calm down, please.

227
00:13:05,980 --> 00:13:07,038
A spirit is trying to possess her.

228
00:13:07,038 --> 00:13:07,776
Really?

229
00:13:07,776 --> 00:13:08,887
It's about to go in.

230
00:13:08,887 --> 00:13:09,806
Who is it?

231
00:13:10,271 --> 00:13:12,191
It's okay. I told him.

232
00:13:12,231 --> 00:13:12,711
Okay.

233
00:13:12,711 --> 00:13:15,111
Wait a moment. Talk to me after.

234
00:13:15,791 --> 00:13:18,142
Just a moment. I'm here to help your descendants.

235
00:13:18,634 --> 00:13:19,104
Okay.

236
00:13:19,104 --> 00:13:20,579
The ancestors are already here.

237
00:13:20,579 --> 00:13:21,487
The one who came is...

238
00:13:21,487 --> 00:13:22,128
It's Grandfather.

239
00:13:22,259 --> 00:13:23,111
I see Grandfather.

240
00:13:26,991 --> 00:13:27,871
Not yet.

241
00:13:28,178 --> 00:13:29,551
Wait for me.

242
00:13:29,991 --> 00:13:31,551
Ma'am, stay calm. Don't let it go in yet.

243
00:13:32,335 --> 00:13:35,271
Also, I heard a voice say it's like a curse.

244
00:13:39,528 --> 00:13:42,491
For the deaths, I see hanging.

245
00:13:43,429 --> 00:13:45,042
I see one death from illness.

246
00:13:45,042 --> 00:13:48,110
The rest died unnaturally.

247
00:13:48,954 --> 00:13:51,391
Some were accidents.

248
00:13:51,572 --> 00:13:52,684
Some were intentional.

249
00:13:54,212 --> 00:13:55,551
Intentional...

250
00:13:56,072 --> 00:13:58,242
It's like this place is cursed.

251
00:13:59,150 --> 00:14:01,437
Hmm, I see four young men.

252
00:14:01,437 --> 00:14:02,911
Around the neck like this.

253
00:14:02,944 --> 00:14:06,791
Something's choking me.
That's why my throat hurts so much.

254
00:14:07,176 --> 00:14:08,311
It seems

255
00:14:08,886 --> 00:14:10,254
that person died by suicide.

256
00:14:12,552 --> 00:14:14,457
Why does his suicide attempt still...

257
00:14:17,265 --> 00:14:20,551
Have you ever thought about suicide?

258
00:14:24,671 --> 00:14:27,119
I did once.

259
00:14:27,547 --> 00:14:28,711
I tried.

260
00:14:28,979 --> 00:14:30,431
Took my own life...

261
00:14:30,892 --> 00:14:31,971
Hanging.

262
00:14:32,944 --> 00:14:34,098
I survived

263
00:14:34,504 --> 00:14:35,871
because I fell down first.

264
00:14:37,507 --> 00:14:39,378
So I'm not sure

265
00:14:39,378 --> 00:14:40,436
if that deceased young man

266
00:14:40,703 --> 00:14:42,071
is your son

267
00:14:42,071 --> 00:14:43,831
or a cousin.

268
00:14:43,831 --> 00:14:45,551
He keeps saying:

269
00:14:46,047 --> 00:14:47,831
never end your life like he did.

270
00:14:47,831 --> 00:14:49,969
You must not die like him.

271
00:14:50,364 --> 00:14:53,311
You did nothing wrong.

272
00:14:53,311 --> 00:14:54,981
This isn't your fault.

273
00:14:55,111 --> 00:14:56,631
Don't feel guilty or blame yourself.

274
00:14:56,756 --> 00:14:58,583
He told me

275
00:14:58,583 --> 00:15:01,073
he's watching over you from a peaceful place.

276
00:15:01,116 --> 00:15:04,248
So don't worry, and never do that again.

277
00:15:05,455 --> 00:15:07,071
I heard this one phrase.

278
00:15:08,394 --> 00:15:11,315
Something like "Take care of yourself."

279
00:15:12,381 --> 00:15:13,511
It's your nephew.

280
00:15:16,517 --> 00:15:17,813
It's Aoy.

281
00:15:18,932 --> 00:15:20,247
Aoy is your nephew.

282
00:15:20,247 --> 00:15:22,013
He hanged himself right in front of the house.

283
00:15:23,111 --> 00:15:25,259
[The deceased who took his own life]
Aoy was my husband's nephew.

284
00:15:25,259 --> 00:15:29,235
We were close. He'd always ask me to cook for him.

285
00:15:29,511 --> 00:15:31,265
He wanted this and that.

286
00:15:31,265 --> 00:15:33,168
He'd come to me for advice and tell me everything.

287
00:15:33,350 --> 00:15:35,591
So we had a deep bond.

288
00:15:36,909 --> 00:15:38,711
I want you to just let it go.

289
00:15:38,779 --> 00:15:40,427
You've been through so much.

290
00:15:40,660 --> 00:15:41,622
You've endured and tried your best.

291
00:15:41,697 --> 00:15:42,591
You've truly done well.

292
00:15:42,851 --> 00:15:45,106
Since marrying into this home,

293
00:15:45,106 --> 00:15:46,121
you've only faced hardship.

294
00:15:46,591 --> 00:15:51,476
You deserve a better, happier life.

295
00:15:52,053 --> 00:15:53,431
He's saying something like

296
00:15:53,431 --> 00:15:55,996
he's sorry he couldn't give you a better life.

297
00:15:56,018 --> 00:15:58,412
He loves you so much.

298
00:15:58,412 --> 00:15:59,662
He misses you.

299
00:16:01,458 --> 00:16:02,711
Stay strong.

300
00:16:03,456 --> 00:16:04,536
You've worked so hard.

301
00:16:05,031 --> 00:16:07,175
So hard.

302
00:16:07,603 --> 00:16:09,014
You've been through enough.

303
00:16:09,014 --> 00:16:10,256
You did well. You're so strong.

304
00:16:10,256 --> 00:16:11,357
Hmph.

305
00:16:12,212 --> 00:16:13,500
Well done! Well done!

306
00:16:13,652 --> 00:16:15,737
Stay strong, ma'am.

307
00:16:15,737 --> 00:16:17,596
I'm fighting with you.

308
00:16:24,625 --> 00:16:25,394
Okay.

309
00:16:28,793 --> 00:16:31,120
The energy here is so sad.

310
00:16:48,244 --> 00:16:49,665
The family...

311
00:16:49,665 --> 00:16:50,790
The land...

312
00:16:51,098 --> 00:16:52,480
Got cursed.

313
00:16:57,403 --> 00:16:59,920
I see crows, arguments,

314
00:17:01,390 --> 00:17:04,240
people cursing each other.

315
00:17:09,822 --> 00:17:13,880
I think I've found the guardian spirit's energy.

316
00:17:18,351 --> 00:17:20,920
(From the moment I stepped in that area,)

317
00:17:20,920 --> 00:17:24,937
(there's a scent of bad deaths all around.)

318
00:17:25,309 --> 00:17:27,097
All right, here it comes.

319
00:17:28,355 --> 00:17:30,770
Every time I try to connect with a spirit,

320
00:17:30,866 --> 00:17:33,857
other spirits keep cutting in.

321
00:17:35,664 --> 00:17:39,500
request passage.

322
00:17:39,500 --> 00:17:41,341
I claim this place.

323
00:17:42,033 --> 00:17:46,057
Whoever guards this land, come forth and speak to me

324
00:17:46,057 --> 00:17:47,131
right now.

325
00:17:52,020 --> 00:17:52,908
Okay.

326
00:17:54,324 --> 00:17:55,286
Behind him.

327
00:17:55,286 --> 00:17:56,348
Behind him?

328
00:17:56,348 --> 00:17:57,124
Ma'am.

329
00:17:57,626 --> 00:17:59,700
It's close. Really close.

330
00:18:12,440 --> 00:18:13,626
This house feels

331
00:18:13,626 --> 00:18:14,626
strange.

332
00:18:15,426 --> 00:18:17,239
The layout and all.

333
00:18:17,239 --> 00:18:19,323
It's all confusing.

334
00:18:20,830 --> 00:18:22,999
Why is the shrine behind the house?

335
00:18:22,999 --> 00:18:24,394
Why isn't it in front?

336
00:18:24,394 --> 00:18:25,211
Yeah, it's weird.

337
00:18:26,163 --> 00:18:28,463
The cards wouldn't answer anything.

338
00:18:30,577 --> 00:18:32,450
I didn't know what to do.

339
00:18:37,053 --> 00:18:38,945
Maybe that day,

340
00:18:38,945 --> 00:18:40,954
I wore too many sacred objects.

341
00:18:40,986 --> 00:18:43,637
The spirits might have been afraid of them.

342
00:18:43,637 --> 00:18:45,913
Maybe that blocked my reading. So I decided

343
00:18:46,020 --> 00:18:49,055
to take off all my amulets.

344
00:18:53,320 --> 00:18:55,118
I've taken off all my amulets now because

345
00:18:56,675 --> 00:18:58,067
I couldn't read at all.

346
00:18:58,482 --> 00:19:00,600
Can I move over there?

347
00:19:01,378 --> 00:19:02,695
Som spirit wants to talk to me.

348
00:19:04,503 --> 00:19:07,748
A man is standing there waving me over.

349
00:19:11,258 --> 00:19:12,068
Oh.

350
00:19:13,743 --> 00:19:14,580
The pond.

351
00:19:15,550 --> 00:19:18,139
I see spirits

352
00:19:18,407 --> 00:19:20,930
coming to drink water here.

353
00:19:22,918 --> 00:19:23,751
I found it.

354
00:19:26,772 --> 00:19:28,667
As I kept pulling cards,

355
00:19:28,667 --> 00:19:31,897
the answers finally started coming through.

356
00:19:31,897 --> 00:19:33,334
It's like this and that.

357
00:19:33,334 --> 00:19:36,914
What's strange is the numbers on the cards.

358
00:19:36,914 --> 00:19:39,298
The exact same numbers kept repeating

359
00:19:39,298 --> 00:19:42,012
for every question.

360
00:19:44,214 --> 00:19:45,157
It's like

361
00:19:46,533 --> 00:19:48,000
the owner might

362
00:19:49,515 --> 00:19:52,532
have been involved with something enchanted,

363
00:19:53,811 --> 00:19:56,057
amulets or something like that.

364
00:20:01,164 --> 00:20:03,228
[DEATH]

365
00:20:03,228 --> 00:20:06,305
Who'd expect I'd get the Death card

366
00:20:06,305 --> 00:20:07,473
when I asked about the owner's personality?

367
00:20:08,357 --> 00:20:09,351
And then

368
00:20:09,351 --> 00:20:12,290
every card had a seven in it.

369
00:20:23,569 --> 00:20:25,500
(Okay, I'd like to go inside.)

370
00:20:54,648 --> 00:20:55,568
Be careful.

371
00:20:59,518 --> 00:21:00,619
There are so many ghosts.

372
00:21:01,666 --> 00:21:04,423
Some spirits keep cutting in.

373
00:21:05,781 --> 00:21:06,671
Attached to her.

374
00:21:10,088 --> 00:21:11,275
When I went upstairs,

375
00:21:11,275 --> 00:21:13,573
I saw Dear walking corner to corner,

376
00:21:14,128 --> 00:21:18,894
and Hye-mi was waving her fan around.

377
00:21:19,194 --> 00:21:21,802
But what others told me later

378
00:21:21,802 --> 00:21:25,019
was that while I was reading cards,

379
00:21:28,503 --> 00:21:30,376
Dear saw a shadow perched on my shoulder,

380
00:21:33,825 --> 00:21:35,738
watching what I was doing.

381
00:21:36,968 --> 00:21:38,054
Attached to her.

382
00:21:38,752 --> 00:21:39,734
Really.

383
00:21:39,821 --> 00:21:41,334
Oh, goosebumps.

384
00:21:47,997 --> 00:21:48,630
Okay.

385
00:21:53,512 --> 00:21:54,765
(I think I've got my answers.)

386
00:21:58,802 --> 00:22:01,454
(It's time to answer the questions.)

387
00:22:03,419 --> 00:22:04,734
It's about to rain.

388
00:22:04,734 --> 00:22:06,294
Let's start over from...

389
00:22:08,175 --> 00:22:10,152
Okay.

390
00:22:10,419 --> 00:22:12,014
Ma'am, are you okay?

391
00:22:13,284 --> 00:22:14,523
As soon as it rained,

392
00:22:14,972 --> 00:22:16,454
just like Aoy said,

393
00:22:17,206 --> 00:22:21,064
we ran to the vans and kept filming inside.

394
00:22:23,212 --> 00:22:25,125
It's my fault.

395
00:22:25,125 --> 00:22:28,770
I forgot to tell Aoy to wait until eight or nine.

396
00:22:33,056 --> 00:22:36,155
From the question about this homeowner,
what's her destiny?

397
00:22:36,155 --> 00:22:40,579
She's faced disappointment and unfulfilled hopes.

398
00:22:42,364 --> 00:22:45,627
Her life sometimes feels adrift.

399
00:22:47,195 --> 00:22:50,882
The first thing that came to me was violent deaths
in this area.

400
00:22:51,203 --> 00:22:53,298
Probably died not far from the house.

401
00:22:53,298 --> 00:22:55,294
Not sure if by hanging or drowning.

402
00:22:58,246 --> 00:23:00,803
I just feel they couldn't breathe.

403
00:23:00,961 --> 00:23:04,434
I'm sure there are at least three to five deaths.

404
00:23:04,434 --> 00:23:06,230
One was elderly.

405
00:23:06,230 --> 00:23:08,335
Could be SUNDS or underlying disease.

406
00:23:08,335 --> 00:23:10,173
Probably heart failure or SUNDS.

407
00:23:10,173 --> 00:23:13,583
Someone died of heart failure.

408
00:23:14,063 --> 00:23:18,531
Like something pierced their heart.
Died of a broken heart.

409
00:23:18,787 --> 00:23:22,368
And I kept sensing one male spirit the whole time.

410
00:23:22,368 --> 00:23:23,885
As for their relationship,

411
00:23:24,046 --> 00:23:27,614
I see a family bond.

412
00:23:27,614 --> 00:23:28,880
Same place.

413
00:23:28,880 --> 00:23:29,574
Same house.

414
00:23:29,574 --> 00:23:31,744
Doing things together.

415
00:23:31,744 --> 00:23:33,974
As for what they liked doing together,

416
00:23:33,974 --> 00:23:35,791
the card that came up there

417
00:23:35,791 --> 00:23:39,614
suggests they liked sitting down to eat together.

418
00:23:39,614 --> 00:23:41,755
Family gatherings and parties.

419
00:23:43,037 --> 00:23:44,534
That's everything.

420
00:23:44,534 --> 00:23:46,414
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

421
00:23:52,324 --> 00:23:53,959
I should ask permission first.

422
00:23:53,959 --> 00:23:57,875
Since we've arrived, I'm asking
the guardian spirits for permission.

423
00:23:57,875 --> 00:24:00,034
[Piipiim - Runes/ Tarot Cards]
I feel two quite different things:

424
00:24:00,147 --> 00:24:01,558
I want to walk in

425
00:24:01,558 --> 00:24:05,267
to read the cards and finish the mission,

426
00:24:05,267 --> 00:24:08,334
while on the other side,
I didn't want to step inside at all.

427
00:24:08,334 --> 00:24:10,386
Could I just lay my cloth and read here?

428
00:24:10,386 --> 00:24:11,914
That spot is bare ground.

429
00:24:11,914 --> 00:24:13,432
It's out in the open.

430
00:24:13,432 --> 00:24:16,296
But I'm worried it might seem

431
00:24:16,296 --> 00:24:19,634
disrespectful to my tools
by putting them on the ground.

432
00:24:20,154 --> 00:24:21,565
So I was the slowest.

433
00:24:22,570 --> 00:24:23,554
A pond?

434
00:24:24,600 --> 00:24:25,840
This place is not good.

435
00:24:25,840 --> 00:24:27,821
I sense a brutal, murderous energy,

436
00:24:28,355 --> 00:24:31,720
even though it's easy to feel emotional here.

437
00:24:32,063 --> 00:24:33,440
There's too much water,

438
00:24:33,440 --> 00:24:34,383
mixed with heavy negative energy.

439
00:24:34,383 --> 00:24:36,413
Actually, in Saju,

440
00:24:36,413 --> 00:24:38,027
I'm a Water element.

441
00:24:38,027 --> 00:24:39,640
But a small Water element.

442
00:24:39,640 --> 00:24:41,030
To strengthen my Water element,

443
00:24:41,030 --> 00:24:44,119
I usually wear rings or black accessories.

444
00:24:44,119 --> 00:24:45,487
Black boosts water elemental energy.

445
00:24:45,487 --> 00:24:48,160
But right now, I don't need to boost
water elemental energy.

446
00:24:48,160 --> 00:24:49,570
At least not here.

447
00:24:49,570 --> 00:24:51,590
So I quickly took off my rings and bracelets

448
00:24:51,590 --> 00:24:53,524
that I wear to boost water elemental energy.

449
00:24:53,609 --> 00:24:56,399
The murderous energy here is strong,

450
00:24:56,399 --> 00:24:57,446
but there's no life force left at all.

451
00:24:57,607 --> 00:24:59,080
Shall we check over there?

452
00:25:00,225 --> 00:25:02,448
Why does this feel like
that the inherited land is involved?

453
00:25:02,448 --> 00:25:04,640
This is about documents and contracts.

454
00:25:04,640 --> 00:25:06,360
- A binding agreement?
- Yes.

455
00:25:06,766 --> 00:25:11,160
Bound by terms of a mortgage or pawn agreement.

456
00:25:11,511 --> 00:25:12,505
Notice this?

457
00:25:12,505 --> 00:25:14,482
When it comes to card divination,

458
00:25:14,482 --> 00:25:15,872
they started the divination soon.

459
00:25:15,872 --> 00:25:16,609
Right now,

460
00:25:16,694 --> 00:25:18,360
Master Boy and Master Beam are doing divination here.

461
00:25:18,437 --> 00:25:20,680
What is this homeowner's life chart like?

462
00:25:20,680 --> 00:25:23,080
Wow, this is a fighter's chart.

463
00:25:23,880 --> 00:25:24,960
We wrote the same thing.

464
00:25:24,960 --> 00:25:25,918
Struggling through.

465
00:25:25,918 --> 00:25:26,680
A lot.

466
00:25:26,680 --> 00:25:28,654
This person possesses the traits for doing business,

467
00:25:28,654 --> 00:25:31,280
as Mercury, Sun, and Rahu are here.

468
00:25:31,280 --> 00:25:32,597
Oh, you cast her chart, right?

469
00:25:32,597 --> 00:25:33,360
Yes.

470
00:25:33,360 --> 00:25:34,553
Do you know what I feel right now?

471
00:25:34,553 --> 00:25:35,772
Master Beam and Master Boy

472
00:25:36,028 --> 00:25:37,182
are working as a group.

473
00:25:37,182 --> 00:25:39,040
Sitting close, like they're reading together.

474
00:25:39,769 --> 00:25:41,520
Sharing information?

475
00:25:41,520 --> 00:25:42,280
Just checking.

476
00:25:42,440 --> 00:25:42,986
Checking the timing.

477
00:25:42,986 --> 00:25:44,440
Checking the chart.

478
00:25:44,450 --> 00:25:45,732
- Right, we're not teaming up.
- Right.

479
00:25:45,732 --> 00:25:46,619
Our answers won't match anyway.

480
00:25:46,619 --> 00:25:47,496
They're different.

481
00:25:47,496 --> 00:25:49,206
Better not catch you. Better not catch you.

482
00:25:54,614 --> 00:25:55,789
Piipiim looks stressed.

483
00:25:55,789 --> 00:25:57,640
She's the only one looking that tense.

484
00:25:59,359 --> 00:26:00,762
From the reading,

485
00:26:00,845 --> 00:26:02,493
the homeowner

486
00:26:02,493 --> 00:26:04,866
actually has a sixth sense too.

487
00:26:07,310 --> 00:26:10,000
Normally, she's someone who can

488
00:26:10,000 --> 00:26:12,782
connect with the occult and the unseen from the start,

489
00:26:15,711 --> 00:26:19,048
but she refused to accept it because she just wanted
a normal, peaceful life.

490
00:26:19,270 --> 00:26:20,082
Auntie,

491
00:26:20,082 --> 00:26:21,984
could you sense anything like that?

492
00:26:22,626 --> 00:26:24,133
I only sensed one.

493
00:26:24,133 --> 00:26:25,480
When he came,

494
00:26:25,480 --> 00:26:28,365
I would lose consciousness.

495
00:26:28,365 --> 00:26:31,478
If I tell anyone about it, they'll think I am crazy.

496
00:26:40,826 --> 00:26:43,648
Whoa, Piipiim is using a pendulum.

497
00:26:43,648 --> 00:26:45,724
It's a tool you just hold still,

498
00:26:45,935 --> 00:26:48,043
and then you ask it questions.

499
00:26:48,043 --> 00:26:50,400
It swings to show yes or no.

500
00:26:51,845 --> 00:26:53,269
The pendulum started swinging

501
00:26:53,342 --> 00:26:54,464
really hard.

502
00:26:54,464 --> 00:26:55,992
Usually,

503
00:26:55,992 --> 00:26:57,480
the pendulum I use

504
00:26:57,584 --> 00:26:59,720
is made of brass,

505
00:26:59,720 --> 00:27:00,751
so it's pretty heavy.

506
00:27:00,791 --> 00:27:05,130
So wind or hand movement
can't easily swing it like that.

507
00:27:05,130 --> 00:27:08,280
It swung harder and harder.

508
00:27:08,496 --> 00:27:09,963
That was when I sensed

509
00:27:09,963 --> 00:27:11,970
this mission wouldn't be easy.

510
00:27:11,970 --> 00:27:13,362
There was lots of energy.

511
00:27:13,933 --> 00:27:14,855
It felt so suffocating.

512
00:27:14,984 --> 00:27:18,000
I was tense all over, with a headache,

513
00:27:18,340 --> 00:27:19,680
blurred vision,

514
00:27:19,971 --> 00:27:23,947
and total overwhelming discomfort.

515
00:27:23,947 --> 00:27:25,350
Why shut me out?

516
00:27:27,388 --> 00:27:29,496
Piipiim looked the most stressed out

517
00:27:29,496 --> 00:27:30,512
among all of them.

518
00:27:39,454 --> 00:27:40,790
Why does it feel like

519
00:27:41,474 --> 00:27:44,383
the spirit's mood swings back and forth?

520
00:27:44,574 --> 00:27:47,267
It's strange. Why did this card keep coming up?

521
00:27:47,267 --> 00:27:50,663
It looks good and seems very protective,

522
00:27:51,040 --> 00:27:54,223
yet this house seems to have endured so much.

523
00:27:55,464 --> 00:27:57,823
It's like someone was lost at a very young age.

524
00:27:58,147 --> 00:27:59,754
These cards give me chills.

525
00:27:59,754 --> 00:28:03,239
They were all about death and loss.

526
00:28:05,308 --> 00:28:08,525
From reading the cards,

527
00:28:08,525 --> 00:28:09,801
and doing this reading,

528
00:28:09,801 --> 00:28:12,077
I sense you've struggled since childhood.

529
00:28:13,077 --> 00:28:15,236
You've been on your own for a long time.

530
00:28:16,070 --> 00:28:17,278
The subject has a broken fate.

531
00:28:17,588 --> 00:28:18,592
Especially

532
00:28:19,276 --> 00:28:20,708
over the last four or five years,

533
00:28:20,997 --> 00:28:22,760
it's been full of grief and worry.

534
00:28:22,782 --> 00:28:26,212
You've been through many painful partings.

535
00:28:26,875 --> 00:28:29,328
You've faced so much loss and separation,

536
00:28:29,761 --> 00:28:33,266
especially losing several men

537
00:28:33,266 --> 00:28:35,585
who walked out of your life.

538
00:28:35,585 --> 00:28:36,848
That's how I see it.

539
00:28:39,251 --> 00:28:42,799
I sense quite a lot of people passed away here,

540
00:28:42,799 --> 00:28:45,688
roughly nine to twelve from what I'm picking up.

541
00:28:45,688 --> 00:28:47,662
Most of them

542
00:28:47,662 --> 00:28:48,357
died

543
00:28:48,859 --> 00:28:50,291
in water accidents,

544
00:28:50,591 --> 00:28:51,446
by drowning.

545
00:28:51,617 --> 00:28:54,021
Two people died together in one incident.

546
00:28:54,085 --> 00:28:56,848
I'd say around five people.

547
00:28:57,997 --> 00:29:00,316
Some died suddenly in their sleep,

548
00:29:00,316 --> 00:29:03,768
and one other person went missing.

549
00:29:03,768 --> 00:29:05,488
Actually,

550
00:29:05,488 --> 00:29:09,008
it wasn't just one incident.

551
00:29:09,059 --> 00:29:10,256
Drowning

552
00:29:10,790 --> 00:29:12,521
and severe illness were involved too.

553
00:29:12,596 --> 00:29:15,208
As for the relationship
between the deceased and the homeowner,

554
00:29:15,653 --> 00:29:17,459
I think the deceased was a husband,

555
00:29:17,459 --> 00:29:21,648
and a lot of heartbreak was involved.

556
00:29:21,648 --> 00:29:22,995
I think the deceased was a mother.

557
00:29:23,326 --> 00:29:26,575
Sibling, or someone close.

558
00:29:26,575 --> 00:29:28,478
Separated by life or death.

559
00:29:28,478 --> 00:29:30,241
It could be a husband

560
00:29:30,241 --> 00:29:33,298
or a blood relative.

561
00:29:38,043 --> 00:29:40,009
Now for the crucial moment.

562
00:29:40,116 --> 00:29:43,162
Someone is joining us to make the call today.

563
00:29:43,162 --> 00:29:47,939
Please welcome the homeowner, Auntie Ploen,
Ploenta Daengserikul.

564
00:29:54,673 --> 00:29:56,244
Hello, Auntie Ploen.

565
00:29:56,244 --> 00:29:58,274
Hello, great to see you again.

566
00:29:58,766 --> 00:30:02,794
Auntie Ploen, when our masters visited your home,

567
00:30:02,998 --> 00:30:04,634
