570
00:30:09,678 --> 00:30:10,843
Thank you so much.

571
00:30:10,843 --> 00:30:11,994
From the bottom of my heart.

572
00:30:12,467 --> 00:30:14,241
Auntie Ploen, it's time

573
00:30:14,241 --> 00:30:19,234
