583
00:30:50,183 --> 00:30:52,054
These two were spot-on.

584
00:30:52,054 --> 00:30:52,738
So accurate.

585
00:30:59,321 --> 00:31:02,560
Auntie Ploen's first choice is Master...

586
00:31:03,511 --> 00:31:05,954
Dear.

587
00:31:15,780 --> 00:31:17,159
Congratulations, Master Dear!

588
00:31:17,159 --> 00:31:19,798
You're in the Top Six on the Seer's Throne.

589
00:31:19,798 --> 00:31:20,450
Please take your seat.

590
00:31:25,837 --> 00:31:31,223
Auntie Ploen's second choice is...

591
00:31:37,326 --> 00:31:38,534
Master...

592
00:31:39,047 --> 00:31:40,468
Hwang Hye-mi.

593
00:31:48,719 --> 00:31:52,940
I picked these two because they impressed me most.

594
00:31:53,111 --> 00:31:57,098
When Master Dear said
someone hanged themselves out front,

595
00:31:57,098 --> 00:31:59,714
