599
00:32:10,425 --> 00:32:12,082
Astonishingly accurate.

600
00:32:13,503 --> 00:32:14,679
If I had to score them,

601
00:32:15,517 --> 00:32:16,763
Master Dear gets 100.

602
00:32:16,859 --> 00:32:17,981
Master Hwang Hye-mi,

603
00:32:18,484 --> 00:32:19,739
99.

604
00:32:19,739 --> 00:32:22,143
I suddenly had a gut feeling

605
00:32:22,143 --> 00:32:23,009
that Master Dear

606
00:32:23,298 --> 00:32:24,804
is someone who

607
00:32:24,804 --> 00:32:27,252
