618
00:32:50,604 --> 00:32:51,801
Everyone has gifts.

619
00:32:51,822 --> 00:32:54,975
Some more, some less, but they're all gifted.

620
00:32:54,975 --> 00:32:57,412
When it comes down to choosing,

621
