630
00:33:13,668 --> 00:33:14,320
That's correct.

631
00:33:14,320 --> 00:33:15,089
Great.

632
00:33:19,317 --> 00:33:24,703
The first master moving on is...

633
00:33:33,648 --> 00:33:35,000
Master...

634
00:33:36,139 --> 00:33:36,731
Boom.

635
00:33:42,648 --> 00:33:46,876
The next master advancing is...

636
00:33:47,408 --> 00:33:48,429
Master...

637
00:33:49,172 --> 00:33:50,353
Ha Byung-yeol.

638
00:33:57,033 --> 00:34:00,966
And the one moving on is...

639
00:34:03,200 --> 00:34:05,124
The tension was agonizing,

640
00:34:05,273 --> 00:34:06,947
