645
00:34:16,667 --> 00:34:19,242
Even though deep down, I'd almost lost hope.

646
00:34:23,528 --> 00:34:25,932
Congratulations to Master...

647
00:34:26,947 --> 00:34:27,787
Yiam!

648
00:34:37,571 --> 00:34:38,779
Honestly,

649
00:34:38,779 --> 00:34:40,947
