652
00:34:45,875 --> 00:34:47,639
All three of them are so talented.

653
00:34:47,639 --> 00:34:50,507
You really have to respect their gifts.

654
00:34:50,507 --> 00:34:52,501
Am I disappointed?

655
00:34:52,715 --> 00:34:54,947
Maybe today just wasn't our day.

656
00:34:55,109 --> 00:34:57,227
Every one of us gave our absolute best.

657
00:34:57,227 --> 00:34:58,307
We have to keep hoping.

658
00:34:58,307 --> 00:34:58,987
Right?

659
00:34:58,987 --> 00:34:59,897
Never lose hope.

660
00:35:00,667 --> 00:35:01,787
Never lose heart.

661
00:35:05,113 --> 00:35:06,427
Moving on to the next group.

662
00:35:06,427 --> 00:35:07,387
Location is...

663
00:35:07,613 --> 00:35:08,627
Rayong.

664
00:35:08,661 --> 00:35:09,227
Yes.

665
00:35:09,227 --> 00:35:10,187
This time,

666
00:35:10,187 --> 00:35:12,107
those heading to Rayong

667
00:35:12,107 --> 00:35:14,763
are these eight masters on stage.

668
00:35:14,763 --> 00:35:18,066
As for their answers on the Rayong house,

669
00:35:18,066 --> 00:35:19,541
how accurate were they?

670
00:35:19,541 --> 00:35:20,289
Pong.

671
00:35:20,289 --> 00:35:20,674
Yes.

672
00:35:20,674 --> 00:35:23,249
What was it like going there?

673
00:35:23,249 --> 00:35:23,955
In Rayong.

674
00:35:23,955 --> 00:35:25,280
The house's design...

675
00:35:25,280 --> 00:35:26,627
The moment we walked in,

676
00:35:26,627 --> 00:35:27,627
honestly,

677
00:35:27,627 --> 00:35:28,587
I was shocked.

678
00:35:29,726 --> 00:35:30,602
Why is that?

679
00:35:31,126 --> 00:35:32,986
The house had a shape

680
00:35:32,986 --> 00:35:34,589
where anyone seeing it would think,

681
00:35:34,589 --> 00:35:36,833
"Why build it like this?"

682
00:35:37,677 --> 00:35:39,110
Was it built upside down?

683
00:35:40,948 --> 00:35:42,123
Not upside down,

684
00:35:42,166 --> 00:35:43,502
not literally upside down.

685
00:35:43,502 --> 00:35:44,827
But the way it's built...

686
00:35:44,827 --> 00:35:45,255
Yes?

687
00:35:46,347 --> 00:35:50,289
(It sits in the middle of open fields,)

688
00:35:50,289 --> 00:35:52,800
(surrounded by trees,)

689
00:35:52,800 --> 00:35:53,655
(and man,)

690
00:35:53,901 --> 00:35:57,161
(it looks like a temple, like a crematorium.)

691
00:35:57,161 --> 00:35:59,117
(Like a place where they burn bodies.)

692
00:35:59,117 --> 00:36:00,667
(- Oh, gosh!
- Seriously.)

693
00:36:03,830 --> 00:36:05,839
(You can't do that!)

694
00:36:05,839 --> 00:36:06,630
(It's just like that.)

695
00:36:06,630 --> 00:36:08,949
[Rayong Province]

696
00:36:10,146 --> 00:36:11,747
(People call me Tik.)

697
00:36:12,316 --> 00:36:14,838
(I was born with strange curses around me.)

698
00:36:15,639 --> 00:36:18,269
(I've had many near-death experiences,
which made me think,)

699
00:36:18,269 --> 00:36:19,861
("How the heck did I survive?")

700
00:36:23,121 --> 00:36:27,267
(This house was built for a wedding.)

701
00:36:28,197 --> 00:36:34,827
[Sornsuchart Boonpleum, Rayong Homeowner]
Yet during construction, terrible things happened.

702
00:36:35,497 --> 00:36:37,356
The workers building the house

703
00:36:37,527 --> 00:36:39,707
died one by one.

704
00:36:40,328 --> 00:36:43,277
Though the house is finished now,

705
00:36:43,277 --> 00:36:46,345
I still can't move in,

706
00:36:46,558 --> 00:36:48,290
and there's no way

707
00:36:48,781 --> 00:36:51,867
to fix it.

708
00:37:02,045 --> 00:37:03,667
The door is open.

709
00:37:03,667 --> 00:37:05,411
Step right in, Chen Jingtao.

710
00:37:33,347 --> 00:37:34,467
I feel so sick to my stomach.

711
00:37:34,467 --> 00:37:36,266
I feel awful. Really awful.

712
00:37:37,933 --> 00:37:41,547
I smell decay and severe illness here.

713
00:37:41,642 --> 00:37:43,227
Many paranormal events happened here.

714
00:37:43,227 --> 00:37:44,730
I feel a female spirit's energy,

715
00:37:45,543 --> 00:37:47,507
