716
00:37:47,507 --> 00:37:50,227
And there are others, not just one.

717
00:37:51,015 --> 00:37:52,383
(They really showed up.)

718
00:37:52,383 --> 00:37:54,830
When friends came by for a fishing rod,

719
00:37:54,947 --> 00:37:55,627
