726
00:38:06,244 --> 00:38:08,587
(I think something terrible happened here.)

727
00:38:08,587 --> 00:38:09,827
It feels burning hot.

728
00:38:15,147 --> 00:38:16,226
Oh, I want to throw up.

729
00:38:17,748 --> 00:38:19,982
I feel really nauseous.

730
00:38:20,534 --> 00:38:21,852
Let me check downstairs.

731
00:38:27,598 --> 00:38:29,099
Let's see what the basement was used for.

732
00:38:35,902 --> 00:38:38,072
I have a dowsing rod to track energy.

733
00:38:38,638 --> 00:38:43,019
(It finds where the yin energy is strongest.)

734
00:38:47,787 --> 00:38:50,672
Downstairs is a portal to the underworld.

735
00:38:50,899 --> 00:38:54,823
Anything tied to underworld deities or spirits

736
00:38:54,823 --> 00:38:55,699
