737
00:38:56,315 --> 00:38:57,755
It's not safe to go down there.

738
00:38:57,755 --> 00:39:00,155
Down there, you'll easily hear strange sounds

739
00:39:01,795 --> 00:39:03,275
and suffer sudden mood swings.

740
00:39:04,986 --> 00:39:06,129
Oh, it's getting too much.

741
00:39:07,145 --> 00:39:09,315
I can't take this. I need to get out.

742
00:39:14,316 --> 00:39:15,385
Chen Jingtao.

743
00:39:15,385 --> 00:39:19,072
I heard that when you visited that house,

744
00:39:19,072 --> 00:39:20,119
