745
00:39:20,301 --> 00:39:21,195
Yes.

746
00:39:21,195 --> 00:39:21,754
I saw that.

747
00:39:21,754 --> 00:39:23,464
What happened that day?

748
00:39:24,116 --> 00:39:26,574
I'm very sensitive to illness energy

749
00:39:26,574 --> 00:39:29,342
