752
00:39:32,439 --> 00:39:34,525
Okay, thank you very much.

753
00:39:34,525 --> 00:39:35,274
Thank you.

754
00:39:35,274 --> 00:39:37,090
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

755
00:39:39,068 --> 00:39:39,879
Matoom.

756
00:39:40,446 --> 00:39:41,868
Remember the auditions, Nui?

757
00:39:41,868 --> 00:39:43,108
In the Box Room,

758
00:39:43,108 --> 00:39:43,984
when

759
00:39:44,647 --> 00:39:47,799
it felt like a spirit would possess us.

760
00:39:47,799 --> 00:39:49,712
That really scared me that day.

761
00:39:49,712 --> 00:39:50,322
Right?

762
00:39:50,920 --> 00:39:52,267
What if you couldn't handle it?

763
00:39:52,267 --> 00:39:54,279
- Say it came on way too strong.
- Right?

764
00:39:54,351 --> 00:39:55,697
Then you just die, Nui.

765
00:39:56,759 --> 00:39:58,316
Once you're in this field,

766
00:39:58,359 --> 00:40:00,208
