767
00:40:01,873 --> 00:40:05,888
Let's see Matoom and Weiyi's answers.

768
00:40:13,426 --> 00:40:14,706
Where do we go in? Right here?

769
00:40:15,306 --> 00:40:15,902
Go ahead.

770
00:40:16,230 --> 00:40:18,421
Oh, man.

771
00:40:18,666 --> 00:40:20,391
