780
00:40:46,294 --> 00:40:48,111
Light it, and it goes right out.

781
00:40:55,909 --> 00:40:56,577
So weird.

782
00:40:56,577 --> 00:40:57,742
Something is very wrong with this house.

783
00:41:21,789 --> 00:41:23,149
It's thick with

784
00:41:23,149 --> 00:41:25,294
a lingering sense of

785
00:41:25,709 --> 00:41:28,269
hidden truth.

786
00:41:29,749 --> 00:41:31,247
(Once I went downstairs, I felt)

787
00:41:31,247 --> 00:41:33,770
