801
00:42:19,492 --> 00:42:20,179
Taking them in.

802
00:42:27,094 --> 00:42:28,484
"You were building a house."

803
00:42:28,729 --> 00:42:30,963
The first intention behind it,

804
00:42:31,332 --> 00:42:33,004
