818
00:43:14,697 --> 00:43:15,295
Oh, my!

819
00:43:15,295 --> 00:43:16,941
I really thought like that.

820
00:43:16,941 --> 00:43:18,085
Keep your own corpse?

821
00:43:18,085 --> 00:43:18,801
Right.

822
00:43:21,932 --> 00:43:24,982
Weiyi didn't focus inside the house at all.

823
00:43:25,382 --> 00:43:27,662
Instead, he stayed planted

824
00:43:28,222 --> 00:43:29,584
right out

825
00:43:29,873 --> 00:43:31,230
