826
00:43:33,142 --> 00:43:34,938
Very abnormal. This house is truly abnormal.

827
00:43:35,077 --> 00:43:37,462
Yes, the needle won't stop shaking.

828
00:43:38,062 --> 00:43:39,022
So weird.

829
00:43:40,079 --> 00:43:42,822
The direction is off. The magnetic field is warped.

830
00:43:43,798 --> 00:43:49,262
I see so many spirits that shouldn't be here.

831
00:43:50,125 --> 00:43:52,188
